@startuml AnySpark v4 - Sequence: 图谱生命周期（知识如何长出）
!theme plain
title AnySpark v4 — 顺序图：图谱生命周期（章节 → 抽取 → 入库 → 注入）
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor User
participant "Agent 循环\n/core.loop" as Agent
participant "写作工具\n/tools_domain" as Tools
participant "routes_chat\n/routes_chat" as Chat
participant "后台 Worker\n/tasks" as BG
participant "GraphExtractor\n/graph.extract" as GX
participant "GraphStore\n/graph.schema" as GS
participant "PlotResolver\n/template.plot" as PR
participant "routes_graph\n/routes_graph" as GR
participant "GraphInjector\n/graph.inject" as GI

== 章节落盘（写作主链路） ==
User -> Agent: 写第 N 章
Agent -> Tools: write_chapter(title, content)
Tools --> Chat: 章节已保存
Chat -> BG: _bg_queue.put(BgTask(kind="chapter"))

== 后台抽取（不阻塞响应） ==
BG -> GX: extract_chapter(deps)
GX -> GS: list_entities（已有实体做去重）
GX -> GX: GraphExtractor.extract（LLM 提实体/关系/事件）
GX -> GS: ingest_chapter（合并入库，含类型集）
GX -> PR: plot_resolver.resolve（伏笔自动回收）
PR --> GX: 回收的伏笔清单
BG -> Manual: review_for_learning（本章偏好/雷区 → 心智）

== 消费（注入/查询） ==
User -> Chat: 写第 N+1 章
Chat -> GI: make_agent → 当前时空点已知事实
GI -> GS: known_facts(up_to_order=N+1, 最近实体/关系/事件)
GS --> GI: 事实摘要（15 实体/20 关系/8 事件）
GI --> Chat: 注入块「已固化事实（知识图谱）」
Agent --> User: 写作基于已知事实，不冲突
User -> GR: 图谱面板查看/编辑
GR -> GS: entities/relations/events CRUD
@enduml
